.gradle/
build/
*.class
.DS_Store

# ── Knowledge graphs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CodeGraph's index is per-machine; .codegraph/ keeps its own ignore file.
# Graphify outputs are regenerated by hooks, so only the graph itself and the
# accumulated Q&A records are worth committing. The patterns are `**/`-prefixed
# on purpose: a bare `graphify-out/*` is anchored to this file's directory and
# would silently start tracking a nested graph such as specs/graphify-out/.
*.graphify-bak
**/graphify-out/*
!**/graphify-out/graph.json
!**/graphify-out/memory/
